    <description>Carries a converted Lead's additional borrowers onto its Transaction and gives each one a Person Account. Mirrors Lead_Document_Requests_Carry_Forward_On_Conversion: the trigger is Converted_Transaction_ID__c becoming non-null, which is the only reliable signal that conversion has finished, and is written by both conversion paths (Convert_Lead and Convert_Lead_to_Person_Account_on_TRID_Date).</description>
